Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 09:41:09 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] msxml3: selections, namespace managers, parse errors with
 positions and codes, importNode, SAX and writer gaps (3000)

IXMLDOMSelection: expr (get and put re-runs the query), context, putref_context,
peekNode, matches, removeNext, removeAll, clone, getProperty/setProperty
(SelectionLanguage), and the enumerator's Skip and Clone.
IVBMXNamespaceManager: reset, pushNodeContext (a node's declarations, and its
descendants' when deep), getDeclaredPrefixes and getPrefixes (an
IMXNamespacePrefixes with item/length/_newEnum), getURI, getURIFromNode;
IMXNamespaceManager::getURI takes a node too.
Parse errors are real: a failed load records the first libxml2 error, and
IXMLDOMParseError reports its line, column, file position, source text, reason,
url and the msxml error code (XML_E_ENDTAGMISMATCH, XML_E_INVALIDATROOTLEVEL,
XML_E_MISSINGROOT, ... from libxml2's codes). IPersistStreamInit::Load returns
that code, IXMLDOMDocument::load of a stream S_FALSE, and a byte array of
anything but bytes E_INVALIDARG. The 8 todo_wine marks these settle are gone.
Also: IXMLDOMDocument importNode, nodeFromID, abort, ondataavailable and
ontransformnode, EnumConnectionPoints/EnumConnections; transformNodeToObject
for every node type (the document's no longer leaks the output document interface); splitText
of a text node (the tail becomes an adjacent text node); processing instruction
attribute maps (xml declaration); ISAXXMLReader base and secure base URLs;
ISAXAttributes getType/getTypeFromName/getTypeFromQName (CDATA); a reader's
resolveEntity calls the entity resolver; MXXMLWriter's entity, error and
locator handlers return S_OK and unparsedEntityDecl writes the declaration;
IMXAttributes setAttribute, setAttributes, addAttributeFromIndex (removeAttribute
no longer leaks); schema cache validate and validateOnLoad; ServerXMLHTTP
getOption/setOption/setTimeouts/waitForResponse; legacy IXMLDocument URL,
readyState, charset, mimeType, dtdURl, file size and dates; IXMLElementCollection
type info, enumerator Skip/Clone, IXMLElement tagName.

